She guarded the first-formed father of the world,
who had been created alone,
and delivered him from his own transgression;

She guided a righteous man fleeing his brother’s anger along upright paths;
she showed him God’s kingdom
and gave him knowledge of holy things;
she made him prosper in his hardships
and multiplied the fruit of his labors.

Therefore the righteous plundered the ungodly
